OFFICIAL-SENSITIVE

The West Coast Main Line (Carlisle to Lancaster) is closed between Carlisle and Lancaster from 1000 because of flooding at
Shap and near Oxenholme. Rail replacement is not possible on the A591 at Thirlmere or the A6.
We have informed Cumbria County Council highways about the affected level crossings.

